This repository contains no third-party source code. Third-party
dependencies are fetched at build time by Cargo (see Cargo.lock) and are
distributed under their own licenses (MIT and/or Apache-2.0, among others).
Binary distributions of ffimg statically link those dependencies; their
license texts are available from each crate's source package.

All images used by tests, examples and benchmarks are generated
programmatically at run time; no photographs or artworks are included.
